# Architecture

- Stack: Next.js App Router with `src/`, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui.
- Domain: Helen's Massage & Wellness Practice (UK). Copy, dates, and legal wording use British English.
- Currency: GBP only. Format with `formatGbp` from `@/lib/currency`. Never show `$` or other currencies.

# Server vs client

Default to Server Components. Add `'use client'` only when the file needs state, effects, or browser events.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — client boundary with no interactivity
"use client";
export function Price({ amountGbp }: { amountGbp: number }) {
  return <p>{formatGbp(amountGbp)}</p>;
}

// ✅ GOOD — server component
export function Price({ amountGbp }: { amountGbp: number }) {
  return <p>{formatGbp(amountGbp)}</p>;
}
```

Keep client leaves small. Fetch and compose data on the server; pass serialisable props down.
